WEBVTT

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:11.200
Wolfran Row!

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:17.620
That's... Ozz's fairy?!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.450
Klara, see to Lily!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.040
Marlya!

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.580
You won't get away!

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.410
Where are they?

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:50.410
I'm sure of it!

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:55.700
How do you have Ozz's fairy?!

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.700
You'll never find out.

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.750
You're going to die here!

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.540
What?

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.580
Is it going berserk?!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.870
That fairy...!

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.160
A contest of strength, is it?!

00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:06.660
This voice...

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.620
Does it not really want to fight?!

00:02:09.620 --> 00:02:12.500
What? What's it doing?!

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.750
Ash Clad!

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:25.370
Shake yourself loose!

00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:33.870
No way! Why won't it do what I tell it?!

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:38.040
Ozz's fairy is no tool of yours!

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:42.410
What's... this power?!

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.200
That's...

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:54.750
...a fairy?!

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:04.250
The fairy's... vanishing?

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:18.330
How did you obtain Ozz's fairy?

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.950
What's so funny?!

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:31.080
It no longer matters!

00:03:31.080 --> 00:03:34.580
The <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> is now complete!

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:39.700
The world ruled by man is over,
and the ideal world shall emerge!

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.040
I've fulfilled my role!

00:03:42.040 --> 00:03:46.080
Shoot. Go on, shoot!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:58.500
I won't kill anyone, no matter
what reason I may have.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:00.620
I'm placing you under arrest.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:18.200
Show us... the will of the fairies, Archbishop...!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.410
"Episode 19"
"Sad Voices and Black Book"

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.370
What was that voice?

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:44.450
Wolfran stole <i>Black Nine</i> ...

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.080
Marlya?

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.200
Yes?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:53.000
That man who was with him said
"The <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> is now complete."

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.580
Didn't he?

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:55.750
Yes, sir.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:05:01.540
Everything from <i>Black One</i> to <i>Black Eight</i>
is at the Ministry of Fairies, right?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:05.000
If they obtain <i>Black Nine</i> ,
they'll have the whole thing!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.250
Which means, Wolfran has ties to the Ministry!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:12.500
"Dorothea HQ"

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.540
Why the Ministry of Fairies, though?

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.950
We're tight with them.

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:20.450
The culprit was using Ozz's fairy, right?

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:27.580
I heard, in Cidal during the War of Unification,
they were researching how to remove

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:32.910
fairy organs from Fairy Soldiers who died
in battle, and transplant them into other people.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:35.750
Seems it ended in failure at the time, though.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:41.040
In Unified Zesskia, the rule is
that when a Fairy Soldier dies,

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:45.370
the Ministry of Fairies takes custody
of the body and buries it.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:49.910
The fairy organs come to them automatically.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:57.410
So, they cooked up that system so they
could obtain and use our fairy organs.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.040
How dare they...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.700
"If the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> is gathered,

00:06:01.700 --> 00:06:07.000
the world ruled by man will end,
and the ideal world shall emerge."

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:09.660
That's what the culprit said?

00:06:09.660 --> 00:06:10.870
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:18.040
If we're to take on the Ministry, we'll need
enough proof to convince the prime minister.

00:06:18.040 --> 00:06:21.540
Yeah. Keep an eye on the Ministry.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:24.410
Put the Third Unit on it, too.
We'll need plenty of manpower.

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:25.290
Go!

00:06:25.290 --> 00:06:28.080
--Yes, ma'am!
--Understood.
--Yes, ma'am.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:30.290
I'll keep questioning the culprit.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.500
Right.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.580
Excuse me.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:43.660
Director, I want to tell you something.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:45.910
What is it?

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:47.700
Tell me.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.580
The culprit's fairy...
It was behaving sort of strangely.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:07:02.450
Is that because he was a Fairy Soldier
who had received Ozz's fairy organ?

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:05.250
That... might be it.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:08.290
It's just, it was like...

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:10.750
I heard some kind of voice.

00:07:10.750 --> 00:07:13.080
The fairy's voice?

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:18.870
I say "voice," but it's not like
it was speaking clearly.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.910
I'm not sure how to put it.

00:07:20.910 --> 00:07:24.290
Has anything like this ever happened before?

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.410
It was the first time.

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:33.750
And unlike everyone else, I didn't
receive a surgical fairy organ transplant.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.580
Maybe I'm not normal after all...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:42.620
Are you familiar with the term
"fairy possession"?

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:44.700
No.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:50.450
Very rarely it seems, a fairy
can possess a human directly.

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:53.450
They're commonly referred
to as the fairy-possessed.

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:56.450
I'm one of those fairy-possessed?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:08:00.080
We've hidden it until now,
per the director's decision.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.160
It's unprecedented, after all.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:03.950
One more thing.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:13.000
The culprit used Ozz's fairy, but our investigation
turned up info that he's not a Fairy Soldier.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.580
To be exact, even if he
was <i>once</i> a Fairy Soldier,

00:08:16.580 --> 00:08:19.250
he can't be considered one at this point.

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:21.330
What do you mean?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:28.580
Could it mean...

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.160
...his fairy organ is gone?

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:32.620
That's right.

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:36.160
You heard something like a fairy's voice,

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:41.660
and you wiped out the fairy organ
inside the Fairy Soldier's body.

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:46.120
Because I'm fairy-possessed?

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:48.330
That's beyond me.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:58.910
Have a seat, and calm down.

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:07.080
Where I come from, there was a
forest with lots of fairy primordials.

00:09:07.080 --> 00:09:09.160
Suna, eh?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:13.700
Ver and I can see primordials,
with the naked eye.

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:16.580
That's not normal either, is it?

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:23.250
Besides, my fairy is a little different
than Free's and the others.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:29.700
We became Fairy Soldiers by receiving
fairy organs, taken out of fairy imaginals.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.910
That's why they're halfway
like the original imaginal...

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.910
The point is, they're similar to beasts.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:38.830
Veronica...

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:40.790
Her fairy is also...!

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:45.620
Ray Dawn's fairy is also humanoid,
and he's from Suna too.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.580
It seems like too much to be a coincidence.

00:09:49.580 --> 00:09:50.830
Supposing...

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:57.160
It's just a hypothesis, but if all three
including Marlya are fairy-possessed,

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:00.950
then those born in Suna have a
tendency toward fairy possession.

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:04.000
Whether it's all of them, or just a subset...

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:09.750
In Suna, it was determined we must never
enter the fairy primordials' forest.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:13.250
Except for the guardians,
who managed the forest and the fairies.

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:15.410
So as not to trigger fairy possession?

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:17.700
I'm not too clear on that.

00:10:17.700 --> 00:10:21.250
I was a child, so I didn't know the details.

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:25.410
There's someone who can
teach us about fairy possession.

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:30.500
Damien Carme... No, I should
call him Damien Albastora.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:35.250
He said he has a grasp of the full
contents of the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> .

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:36.620
He does?

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.750
He's being kept in the safe house?

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:45.290
Depending on the situation, he might be the
secret weapon that gives us a breakthrough.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.410
All right, go bring Damien here.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:53.950
--Understood!
--Yes, ma'am!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.410
Are you okay?

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:59.830
Yes. I'm fine.

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:01.870
Don't push too hard.

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:03.200
I will.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:07.450
I will push hard. Please let me.

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:09.580
I'm with Dorothea.

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:13.830
I want to perform my duty with everyone.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:16.410
All right. Give it your all, then.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.910
If you fall down, I'll pull you back up.

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:22.370
If you fall, I'll carry you on my back.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.700
I'm <i>heavy</i> .

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:25.910
Let's go.

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.120
Yeah.

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:29.910
"Ministry of Fairies"

00:11:31.160 --> 00:11:32.620
Pardon me.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:39.000
Wolfran Row...

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:42.160
Could that be...!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.250
This is it.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:59.910
Nearest to the Original Fairy,
the holy beast, equal to God.

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:04.870
We finally have the specific
means we seek to revive it.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:12.830
Once the ideal world emerges, the foolish
humans shall repent, and we shall be saved.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:17.250
Soon, it will all be over.

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.160
"Witness Protection Retreat"

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:34.410
I see. If that's the situation,
Marco Bellwood's goal is,

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:41.750
without a doubt, to revive
the godlike Divine Beast.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:44.040
Divine Beast?

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:48.000
It's known as the holy beast, equal to God.

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:53.160
It completely turned the highly prosperous
ancient kingdom of Tupal,

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:58.200
the center of the world, into a desert of death.

00:12:58.200 --> 00:13:03.750
Which would mean, the next step
Bellwood will take is to secure a fusion.

00:13:03.750 --> 00:13:06.450
A fairy-possessed fairy organ...

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.580
I'm... fairy-possessed!

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:14.540
Yes, I suspected so.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:15.910
Ver must be too!

00:13:15.910 --> 00:13:19.830
Isn't she? I think you would know.

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:22.450
Yes, that she is.

00:13:23.700 --> 00:13:27.120
Just what is fairy possession?

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:30.870
It's difficult to answer that question.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:35.080
What did you mean by,
the next step Bellwood will take?

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:38.700
According to the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> ,
one needs a fusion

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:43.120
and a fairy-possessed fairy organ
as elements of the Divine Beast.

00:13:43.120 --> 00:13:46.750
I expect he'll try to secure those.

00:13:46.750 --> 00:13:48.790
Elements of the Divine Beast?

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.250
And I'm...

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:54.660
No, Bellwood shouldn't be aware
that you're fairy-possessed.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.830
What's a fusion?

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:06.080
It's a fairy imaginal that,
via cannibalism and such,

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.330
has come to possess multiple fairy organs.

00:14:08.330 --> 00:14:14.370
At this point, even regular fairy imaginals
are rare, so I doubt any exist.

00:14:14.370 --> 00:14:17.200
I've never even heard the term.

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:22.410
In any case, the situation seems
more urgent than we imagined.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:25.160
Please let me work with you.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.620
"Dorothea HQ"

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.620
A fusion...

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:35.830
A fairy-possessed fairy organ...

00:14:35.830 --> 00:14:41.200
On the off chance they acquire
the elements of the Divine Beast...

00:14:41.200 --> 00:14:45.540
We should probably deal with this
before we imagine such a scenario.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:48.290
I must strengthen my own resolve, too.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.660
Could you let me see the prime minister?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.160
You? See His Excellency?

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:58.540
I will tell him everything firsthand.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:04.370
About the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> my ancestor wrote,
and the whole story surrounding it.

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:07.870
And about the things I've done. Everything.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.950
There'll be repercussions for you.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:14.540
The prime minister might order us to arrest you.

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:18.540
I don't mind. It's my obligation
as part of the Albastora family

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:23.500
to do away with the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> ,
and those who would use it.

00:15:25.120 --> 00:15:28.660
All right. I'll set it up at once.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:31.250
"Prime Minister's Official Residence"

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:36.790
Marco Bellwood... That man was loyal to me.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:42.120
Indeed. He's a capable bureaucrat,
who rose to the position of Fairy Minister.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:47.290
But in the background, he was
using the Ministry of Fairies...

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:50.200
...the power of Unified Zesskia,
to gather the <i>Black Fairy Tome</i> .

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.000
Why?!

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:55.040
Divine Beast?!

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:59.250
Why? Why would he try to revive such a thing?!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.870
Whatever Marco Bellwood's motive is,

00:16:01.870 --> 00:16:05.290
it's an undeniable fact that the Divine Beast
turned the entire kingdom of Tupal

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.410
into a desert of death.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:10.910
He could be trying to
destroy this world, perhaps.

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:15.750
Why does he think we shed so much blood,
and achieved unification?!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.500
Free Underbar.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.580
Yes, sir.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.450
During the War of Unification, I was your enemy.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:27.580
My forces killed your friends
and their families!

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:29.790
They trampled your homeland underfoot!

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:35.580
Despite that, why are you working
for Unified Zesskia?! For Dorothea?!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:41.580
Because... I never again want to see
a conflict like the War of Unification...

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:46.660
Using fairies... and weapons to brutally
slaughter one another...

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.700
I couldn't agree more.

00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:54.950
You're surprised?

00:16:54.950 --> 00:17:00.250
Well know this, I didn't shed all
that blood because I enjoyed it.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:07.120
I dared to wage war in order to make the
senseless act of war a thing of the past.

00:17:07.120 --> 00:17:14.040
Your director, Nein Auler, has had
a dirty job to do since unification.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:18.370
She's no mere subordinate,
she's a valued comrade.

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:22.790
I believed the same was true of Marco Bellwood.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:27.000
But I was being deceived.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.870
Your Excellency, simply give me the order.

00:17:30.870 --> 00:17:34.120
Aren't you sick of all this yet?

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:37.870
I believe I'm walking along the proper path.

00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:40.410
What would turn me aside now?

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:47.410
Arrest Marco Bellwood, and all
his accomplices and collaborators!

00:17:47.410 --> 00:17:48.950
Do whatever it takes.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.250
I entrust this task entirely to Dorothea!

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:53.500
Yes, sir!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:35.660
It's already pretty late, but no Ministry
of Fairies personnel have left yet?

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.450
The Third Unit should have
the rear secured by now.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:42.660
Yeah. As soon as the director's group arrives,
we storm the place.

00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:46.750
Free...

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:49.790
Why'd you become a Fairy Soldier?

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.700
I volunteered.

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:58.120
I was chosen from amongst a large group
to receive a fairy organ transplant.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:18:59.830
I guess it was an honor?

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:04.250
Long story short, I wanted to be
a hero who saved the kingdom.

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:07.950
It wasn't something I took lightly, though.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:11.080
I just thought it was the thing to do.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.830
The truth is, things were rough?

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:17.950
It was war, yeah. It's no fun.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:22.660
Your fairy was forced to fight.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:27.790
Maybe as it fought, it was crying
deep inside the whole time, too.

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:31.790
Sorry, that was a weird thing to say.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:37.120
But nobody wants to become an implement of war.

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:40.290
Our fairies too, huh?

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:44.870
I don't know if it's right or wrong.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.370
But killing someone while you cry
in your heart, while you scream...

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:51.620
That's messed up.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.410
You're right.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:58.500
We Fairy Soldiers were
implements of war. Weapons.

00:19:58.500 --> 00:20:02.410
We killed people for our countries.
For our causes.

00:20:02.410 --> 00:20:06.450
But thanks to that, the war ended.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.370
I sure hope it did.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:13.250
Guys like me aren't needed anymore.
My only talent is fighting.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:15.080
I'm just a weapon, after all.

00:20:15.080 --> 00:20:17.620
Please don't talk like that.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:22.250
If you don't wish for conflict,
I'm sure your fairy feels the same way.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:26.000
Neither you nor your fairy
are implements of war.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.830
You're not weapons.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:34.080
But if there <i>is</i> a conflict there,
we have to put an end to it.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.370
If it's for that sake, our fairies will help us.

00:20:40.370 --> 00:20:42.200
That's the feeling I get.

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:46.200
Ready to go finish the job?

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:47.410
Yes, sir.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:05.620
Director.

00:21:05.620 --> 00:21:09.200
Lily's group already has the rear
entrance and vicinity secured.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:13.000
Anyone who tries to escape
will be met with force.

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.580
Very good.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.410
We're apprehending
Marco Bellwood and Griff Mercer?

00:21:18.410 --> 00:21:20.500
They might have other associates present.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:24.370
Arrest everyone who refuses to
cooperate with us, who resists,

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.660
or who displays suspicious behavior.

00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:33.620
And don't let any other Ministry personnel
set foot outside until I approve it.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.290
We are prepared to shed blood!

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.830
Lawless people who would use fairies

00:21:40.830 --> 00:21:45.910
to disturb the peace of
Unified Zesskia will not be tolerated!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:48.250
We of Dorothea...

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:50.330
...will perform our duty!

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.580
Begin the raid!

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:41.290
There's a fairy-possessed in Dorothea.

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:43.120
They captured a fusion?!

00:23:43.120 --> 00:23:46.870
You're necessary in order to end it all!

00:23:45.950 --> 00:23:48.450
"Next time"
"Forest of Beginnings"

00:23:46.870 --> 00:23:48.450
"Next time"
"Forest of Beginnings"

